Hastie</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Tibshirani</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><source>Generalized additive models</source><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Chapman and Hall</publisher-name><page-count count="336"/></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050111-b023"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Craven</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Wahba</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>1979</year><article-title>Smoothing noisy data with spline functions</article-title><source>Numer Math</source><volume>31</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>403</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050111-b024"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stiles</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>The trade in African and Asian ivory in South and South East Asia</article-title><source>Pachyderm</source><volume>33</volume><fpage>74</fpage><lpage>87</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050111-b025"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>ISC</given-names></name><name><surname>Graham</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>Elephant decline: Downward trends in African elephant distribution and numbers (part 2)</article-title><source>Int J Environ Stud</source><volume>35</volume><fpage>13</fpage><lpage>26</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050111-b026"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Justice</surname><given-names>CO</given-names></name><name><surname>Jiang</surname><given-names>M</g